B.Zh=s(["Fethedilmi\u015f herhangi bir karoya dokunun.","Alt men\xfcdeki SUR \u0130N\u015eA ET butonuna basarak Ah\u015fap \xc7it, Ta\u015f Sur veya Demir Tahkimat se\xe7in.","Mevcut surunuzu istedi\u011finiz zaman daha \xfcst bir kademeye GEL\u0130\u015eT\u0130R\u0130N.","Sava\u015fta hasar alan surlar\u0131 ONAR butonuna basarak tamir edin."],t.s)
B.Xs=s(["Tap any owned hex tile.","Tap BUILD WALL in the action sheet and select Palisade, Rampart, or Iron Fortification.","Upgrade existing walls to higher tiers at any time.","Repair damaged or breached walls using the REPAIR button."],t.s)
B.VK=s(["Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131n etraf\u0131ndaki 6 karoya daire \u015feklinde sur \xe7ekerek a\u015f\u0131lmaz bir i\xe7 kale (Citadel) kurun.","Duvarlar y\u0131k\u0131lsa bile karo fethedilmi\u015f kal\u0131r; sava\u015ftan sonra k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir odun/ta\u015f harcayarak suru eski haline getirebilirsiniz."],t.s)
B.Zv=s(["Fortify all 6 hexes surrounding your Castle to build an impenetrable inner Citadel.","Even if breached, walls retain their foundation and can be restored with minimal resources."],t.s)
