B.QS=new A.bw("migration_prestige_tamga",B.p8,"B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 & Kadim Tamga (Prestij Sistemi)","Great Migration & Tamga Prestige","Diyar\u0131 terk edip k\xfcm\xfclatif Tamgalar ve ata miras\u0131 an\u0131tlar\u0131yla yeni topraklara g\xf6\xe7 etme.","Migrate to new realms, retaining cumulative Tamgas and Ancestral Kurgan relic echoes.",'Ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z yeterince b\xfcy\xfcd\xfc\u011f\xfcnde (en az 12 fethedilmi\u015f karo), sa\u011fdaki Harita butonuna basarak "B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7" ba\u015flatabilirsiniz. G\xf6\xe7 etti\u011finizde kaynaklar s\u0131f\u0131rlan\u0131r ancak:\n\n1. K\xfcm\xfclatif Tamgalar (Prestige Tokens) kazan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z (her Tamga t\xfcm \xfcretime kal\u0131c\u0131 +%4-5 \xe7arpan verir).\n2. Eski diyardaki en g\xf6rkemli binalar\u0131n\u0131z yeni haritada "Atalar Kurgan\u0131" olarak belirir; uyand\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda devasa aura bonusu verir.\n3. Yeni diyarlara (\u0130dil Boyu, Karakum \xc7\xf6l\xfc) yerle\u015fme hakk\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.',"Once reaching 12+ tiles, initiate the Great Migration. You earn permanent Tamga tokens (+4-5% global boost each) and leave behind Ancestral Kurgans.",B.ff,B.c1,"PREST\u0130J S\u0130STEM\u0130",B.a1k,B.VF,B.Va,B.ZG,B.Z0,B.WP)
